" archive is unpacked."
msgstr ""
"位于 ``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/plugins/trae/`` 的压缩包 ``anet-"
"trae-<version>.zip``\\ ，其 SHA-256 记录于 "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/plugins/trae/trae.json``\\ "
"。解压前，请将所下载压缩包的摘要与 ``trae.json`` 中的值进行比对。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:47
msgid ""
"``anet`` does not have to be installed first: the ``anet-setup`` skill of"
" the bundle installs it after the user agrees. A node that is already "
"installed and registered at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, "
":doc:`../intro/tutorial`) is used as it is."
msgstr ""
"无需预先安装 ``anet``\\ ：安装包中的 ``anet-setup`` 技能会在用户同意后安装它。已安装并已在 hub 注册的节点（\\ "
":doc:`../intro/install`\\ 、\\ :doc:`../intro/tutorial`\\ ）将直接沿用。"

