"write a file of Trae, because the location of the global MCP file is not "
"documented consistently:"
msgstr "用户级。脚本输出用户级的条目，不写入 Trae 的文件，因为全局 MCP 文件的位置在文档中的说法并不一致："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:184
msgid ""
"For Trae, the script also prints an install link of the form "
"``trae://trae.ai-ide/mcp-import?type=stdio&name=anet&config=<Base64>``; "
"the Base64 text decodes to the printed entry. No link is printed with "
"``--cn``. How Trae registers the entry is described under `Not tested`_."
msgstr ""
"对于 Trae，脚本还会输出形如 ``trae://trae.ai-ide/mcp-"
"import?type=stdio&name=anet&config=<Base64>`` 的安装链接；其中的 Base64 "
"文本可解码为所输出的条目。使用 ``--cn`` 时不输出链接。Trae 如何登记该条目，参见 `未经测试`_\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:189
msgid ""
"Do not keep two servers named ``anet`` in the same project, for example "
"one from ``anet agents wire`` and one from this bundle. Remove the "
"earlier entry first."
msgstr ""
"不要在同一项目中保留两个名为 ``anet`` 的服务器，例如一个来自 ``anet agents wire``\\ "
"，另一个来自本安装包。请先移除较早的条目。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:195
msgid "Setting up the node from Trae"
msgstr "在 Trae 中配置节点"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:197
msgid "If ``anet`` is not installed or not running, ask in a session:"
msgstr "若 ``anet`` 尚未安装或未运行，请在会话中提出："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:204
msgid "The agent follows the ``anet-setup`` skill:"
msgstr "Agent 按照 ``anet-setup`` 技能执行："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:206
msgid ""
"It runs the runner with ``--resolve``, which reports the executable, the "
"version and the identity, or ``not found``. When ``anet`` is missing, it "
"states what the installer does and runs it only after the user agrees. "
"The installer verifies the signed release manifest and installs to "
"``~/.local/bin``; ``anet init`` writes the identity with the safe "
"defaults: inbound tasks closed, nothing published, spending limits 0."
msgstr ""
"它以 ``--resolve`` 运行运行脚本，报告可执行文件、版本和身份，或报告 ``not found``\\ 。\\ ``anet`` "
"缺失时，它先说明安装程序的作用，并仅在用户同意后运行。安装程序会校验已签名的发布清单并安装到 ``~/.local/bin``\\ ；\\ "
"``anet init`` 按安全默认值写入身份：入站任务关闭、不发布任何内容、支出限额为 0。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:212
msgid ""
"It starts the node with ``anet up`` when the status reports "
"``[daemon_not_running]``."
msgstr "状态报告 ``[daemon_not_running]`` 时，它以 ``anet up`` 启动节点。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:214
msgid ""
"It runs ``anet hub-register`` for the hub and the name that the user "
"gave. When the hub admits by AID, or has used up its sign-ups for the "
"day, the registration stays pending; the agent gives the user the line "
"for the hub operator and does not act on it."
msgstr ""
"它针对用户给出的 hub 和名称运行 ``anet hub-register``\\ 。hub 按 AID "
"准入，或当日注册名额已用完时，注册保持待处理；agent 把需交给 hub 运营方的那一行提供给用户，并且不据此采取行动。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:218
msgid "It runs ``anet doctor`` and reports every check that is not ``ok``."
msgstr "它运行 ``anet doctor``\\ ，并报告每一项不是 ``ok`` 的检查。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:220
msgid ""
"The commands that change who may reach the machine or what it may spend "
"(``anet peers``, ``anet inbound``, ``anet autoreply set``, the spending "
"limits and ``anet pay``) confirm on a terminal. The skills tell the agent"
" to name them and leave them to the user. The skills also tell the agent "
"not to read ``~/.anet`` and not to read or edit the configuration of "
"Trae."
msgstr ""
"更改谁可以访问本机或本机可支出多少的命令（\\ ``anet peers``\\ 、\\ ``anet inbound``\\ 、\\ "
"``anet autoreply set``\\ 、支出限额以及 ``anet pay``\\ ）需在终端确认。技能要求 agent "
"仅指明这些命令，并交由用户执行。技能还要求 agent 不读取 ``~/.anet``\\ ，也不读取或修改 Trae 的配置。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:226
msgid "Start a new session after the setup, so that the MCP server starts."
msgstr "配置完成后请开启新会话，使 MCP 服务器启动。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:230
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:232
msgid ""
"In a new session, run ``/anet-status``. The agent calls ``node_status`` "
"and ``get_balance`` and reports the identity, whether the daemon runs, "
"the hub, the inbound policy and the limits."
msgstr ""
"在新会话中运行 ``/anet-status``\\ 。Agent 调用 ``node_status`` 和 ``get_balance``\\ "
"，并报告身份、守护进程是否运行、hub、入站策略和限额。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:235
msgid "Ask for a task, for example:"
msgstr "交代一项任务，例如："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:243
msgid ""
"The agent calls ``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card`` and ``send_message``,"
" and ``wait_task`` when the task is still working. The report names the "
"state of the task (``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``) and ``anet.effect_status`` "
"as the tools returned them."
msgstr ""
"Agent 调用 ``list_agents``\\ 、\\ ``get_agent_card`` 和 ``send_message``\\ "
"，任务仍在进行时再调用 ``wait_task``\\ 。报告按工具返回的内容给出任务状态（\\ "
"``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``\\ ）和 ``anet.effect_status``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:248
msgid "On a shell, the runner shows what the bundle selects:"
msgstr "在 shell 中，运行脚本可显示安装包所选定的内容："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:258
msgid ""
"The steps in the list above were run with a stand-in for Trae, not with "
"Trae. `Not tested`_ states what that leaves open."
msgstr "上述列表中的步骤是用 Trae 的替代程序运行的，并非在 Trae 中运行。其遗留的未决事项见 `未经测试`_\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:263
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:265
msgid "The bundle has two optional settings, given to ``install.sh``:"
msgstr "安装包有两个可选设置项，通过 ``install.sh`` 给出："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:271
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:272
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:273
msgid "``--identity NAME``"
msgstr "``--identity NAME``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:274
msgid ""
"A named identity (``anet id ls``). ``--identity ''`` selects the default "
"identity in ``~/.anet`` again. The server then runs ``anet --id <name> "
"mcp``."
msgstr ""
"命名身份（\\ ``anet id ls``\\ ）。\\ ``--identity ''`` 将重新选用 ``~/.anet`` "
"中的默认身份。服务器随后运行 ``anet --id <name> mcp``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:277
msgid "``--anet PATH``"
msgstr "``--anet PATH``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:278
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable. ``--anet ''`` searches the "
"locations named above again. A path that is not an executable file is an "
"error; no other copy is used."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径。\\ ``--anet ''`` "
"将重新在上述位置中查找。若路径不是可执行文件，则视为错误，不会改用其他副本。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:282
msgid ""
"An option that is not given keeps the value of the earlier installation. "
"The script keeps the values in two places. The file ``anet/settings`` is "
"read by the runner for the shell commands of the agent. The ``env`` of "
"the MCP entry (``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` and ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``) is read "
"by the launcher. The script does not rewrite an existing "
"``.trae/mcp.json``, and at the user level it only prints the entry. After"
" a change, edit the ``env`` of the registered entry to match, and start a"
" new session. Otherwise the shell commands and the MCP server can use "
"different identities."
msgstr ""
"未给出的选项沿用先前安装的值。脚本把这些值保存在两处：文件 ``anet/settings`` 由运行脚本读取，用于 agent 的 shell "
"命令；MCP 条目的 ``env``\\ （\\ ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 和 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``\\"
" ）由启动脚本读取。脚本不会改写已有的 ``.trae/mcp.json``\\ ，用户级则只输出条目。更改后，请让已登记条目的 ``env`` "
"与之保持一致，并开启新会话；否则 shell 命令与 MCP 服务器可能使用不同的身份。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:293
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:295
msgid ""
"To update the bundle, obtain the newer bundle and run ``install.sh`` "
"again with the same scope. The script is idempotent. ``anet update`` "
"updates ANet itself, independently of the bundle."
msgstr ""
"更新安装包时，获取较新的安装包，并以相同范围再次运行 ``install.sh``\\ 。该脚本是幂等的。\\ ``anet update`` "
"更新 ANet 本身，与安装包相互独立。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:303
msgid ""
"The command deletes the files that the installer wrote and nothing else, "
"and leaves no empty directory that it created. Delete the MCP server "
"``anet`` from Trae, or the member ``anet`` of ``.trae/mcp.json``, and "
"start a new session. Removal does not change the node: the identity in "
"``~/.anet`` and the running daemon remain. :doc:`../intro/install` "
"describes how to stop the node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"该命令仅删除安装程序写入的文件，不删除其他内容，也不会留下由它创建的空目录。请从 Trae 中删除 MCP 服务器 ``anet``\\ ，或删除"
" ``.trae/mcp.json`` 中的成员 ``anet``\\ ，并开启新会话。移除不会改变节点：\\ ``~/.anet`` "
"中的身份和运行中的守护进程均保持不变。停止节点和移除 ANet 的方法见 :doc:`../intro/install`\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:312
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "未经测试"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:314
msgid ""
"Trae is a graphical application without a command line or a headless "
"mode, and it was not run. The steps on this page were run on Linux with a"
" stand-in: a program that loads the skills from ``.trae/skills``, expands"
" the command file, starts the MCP server from ``.trae/mcp.json`` with the"
" arguments and the reduced ``PATH`` that the Trae documentation "
"describes, and gives a language model a shell tool. The stand-in is not "
"Trae. The following are therefore unverified:"
msgstr ""
"Trae 是没有命令行和无头模式的图形应用，本页并未在其中运行。本页步骤是在 Linux 上借助一个替代程序运行的：该程序从 "
"``.trae/skills`` 加载技能，展开命令文件，按 Trae 文档所述的参数和精简的 ``PATH`` 从 "
"``.trae/mcp.json`` 启动 MCP 服务器，并为语言模型提供 shell 工具。该替代程序并非 Trae。因此以下事项尚未验证："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:322
msgid ""
"That Trae or Trae CN loads skills from ``~/.trae/skills``, ``~/.trae-"
"cn/skills`` and ``.trae/skills``, and commands from the corresponding "
"``commands`` directories."
msgstr ""
"Trae 或 Trae CN 是否从 ``~/.trae/skills``\\ 、\\ ``~/.trae-cn/skills`` 和 "
"``.trae/skills`` 加载技能，并从相应的 ``commands`` 目录加载命令。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:325
msgid ""
"Whether Trae accepts the ``description`` front matter of the command "
"file, and under which name it lists ``/anet-status``."
msgstr "Trae 是否接受命令文件中的 ``description`` 前置元数据，以及它以何种名称列出 ``/anet-status``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:327
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"That Trae expands ``${workspaceFolder}`` in ``args`` and starts ``/bin/sh"
" <script>``; that **Project MCP** has to be turned on in the settings for"
" a project entry; and the location of the global MCP file."
msgstr ""
"Trae 是否展开 ``args`` 中的 ``${workspaceFolder}`` 并启动 ``/bin/sh <script>``\\ "
"；项目条目是否需要在设置中开启 **Project MCP**\\ ；以及全局 MCP 文件的位置。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:330
msgid ""
"The registration of the printed entry through **Settings**, **MCP**, "
"**Add**, **Create Manually**, and through the install link, and the "
"install link scheme of Trae CN."
msgstr ""
"通过 **Settings**\\ 、\\ **MCP**\\ 、\\ **Add**\\ 、\\ **Create Manually** "
"以及通过安装链接登记所输出条目的过程，以及 Trae CN 的安装链接方案。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:333
msgid "The environment of the graphical application, in particular its ``PATH``."
msgstr "图形应用的运行环境，尤其是其 ``PATH``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:334
msgid ""
"The behaviour of a client that reads tool schemas strictly. The property "
"``accept`` of the tool ``submit_payment`` has no ``type``. The open-"
"source ByteDance program ``trae-agent``, which is a different program "
"from Trae, rejects it. Whether Trae accepts it is unknown."
msgstr ""
"严格解析工具模式的客户端的行为。工具 ``submit_payment`` 的属性 ``accept`` 没有 ``type``\\ "
"。开源的字节跳动程序 ``trae-agent``\\ （与 Trae 是不同的程序）会拒绝该属性。Trae 是否接受尚不明确。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:338
msgid "macOS. ``install.sh`` was run on Linux with ``dash``, ``bash`` and ``sh``."
msgstr "macOS。\\ ``install.sh`` 仅在 Linux 上以 ``dash``\\ 、\\ ``bash`` 和 ``sh`` 运行过。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:339
msgid "Windows, which ANet does not support."
msgstr "Windows，ANet 不支持该系统。"

